{
 "_comment": "Mission «Корона 6. Свецино, 1462» (mission card in the missions doc, docs/03-missions/17-crown_06_swiecino_1462.md), the last of the Crown campaign. A field battle of two hired armies, each in its wagon fort, on map_crown_06 (tools/maps/gen_crown_06.py): the Polish camp in the south-west with the little lake and its reeds west of it, the field, the Order's rise in the north, the west forest road, Lake Żarnowiec along the east edge. Player 1 is Stach with the royal mercenaries, Dunin, Jasieński's lances and the Gdańsk men; player 3 holds Dunin while he is bandaged in the tabor (an ally, out of the player's hands); enemy 2 the Order (Raweneck's horse, Nostitz's foot in the wagon fort, later the Pomeranian peasants). Rules in core/mission/mission_swiecino.gd (rules.swiecino): the clock, hiring companies for silver (asks.hire) and their wages, the ditch round the tabor, the horses tiring, the crossbows in the reeds, Dunin's command in Stach's hands, Raweneck's death, prisoners for ransom. «The Pact» is locked: Stach turned the stranger away. Read by core/mission/mission_def.gd; cells are map cells, ticks 1/20 s, texts are English keys translated through i18n/*.po.",
